# What NOT to upload to EAS Build.
#
# CAREFUL: this file REPLACES .gitignore for build uploads — it does not add to
# it. Anything .gitignore excluded that is not repeated here comes BACK, which
# is why node_modules leads the list rather than being assumed.
#
# Written because the archive reached 123 MB and stalled on a phone hotspot.
# None of it is needed to build the app: EAS installs dependencies from the
# lockfile on its own machines, and the rest is local scratch.

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/

# Signing material. EAS holds the real credentials remotely (Build Credentials
# dX6Gi0XbOO) — these local copies must never travel in a build archive.
*.jks
credentials/
credentials.json
.env

# Local scratch that accumulated during development.
b.txt
bundle_check.txt
manifest.json
*.log
.codex-*
expo-qr.html
expo-qr*.svg
expo-qr.png

# The build runs from source; a previous build's output is never an input.
*.apk
*.aab
